<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Critical Signals on mixmix</title><link>https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/</link><description>Recent content in Critical Signals on mixmix</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 01 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Restructuring the project</title><link>https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/2026_07_26/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/2026_07_26/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;2025 was made possible through a lot of input from a heap of talented people,
but the main weaver was Sophie Jerram. She did an amazing job, and the project
would not exist without her.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coming into 2026 the crew met to discuss the long-term vision of the project, and decided
we wanted to restructure the project. We invested a lot in building governance and processes
which would allow us to distribute decisions making + authoriy more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was pretty challenging, and if I&amp;rsquo;m honest a bit painful, but I&amp;rsquo;m excited to see
how it changes the course and longevity of this work.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>The first season</title><link>https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/2025_07_18/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mixmix.nz/project/critical-signals/2025_07_18/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This evolved from last years successful &lt;a class="link" href="https://mixmix.nz/project/beautiful-signals/" &gt;Beautiful
Signals&lt;/a&gt;. A 3 months long community space
hosted in Pōneke / Wellington in partnership with the Goethe
Institute, several universities, and many community memebers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I built and maintained the &lt;a class="link" href="criticalsignals.nz" &gt;website&lt;/a&gt; in collaboration with infrastructure by &lt;a class="link" href="https://nikau.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;nikau.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
